---
import HeaderKo from "../../components/HeaderKo.astro";
import Footer from "../../components/Footer.astro";
import ProfessorProfile from "../../components/ProfessorProfile.astro";
import StudentsSection from "../../components/StudentsSection.astro";
---

<html lang="ko">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />

    <title>구성원 | 부유체 동역학 연구실</title>

    <style>
      :root {
        --bg: #f4f7fb;
        --text: #0f172a;
        --muted: #475569;
        --accent: #0f766e;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: Inter, system-ui, sans-serif;

        background:
          radial-gradient(
            circle at top left,
            rgba(14,165,233,0.08),
            transparent 30%
          ),
          var(--bg);

        color: var(--text);
        word-break: keep-all;
      }

      .page {
        max-width: 1180px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 90px 28px 120px;
      }

      .page-label {
        color: var(--accent);
        font-size: 13px;
        letter-spacing: 0.18em;
        font-weight: 700;
        margin-bottom: 18px;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 82px);
        line-height: 0.95;
        letter-spacing: -0.05em;
        margin: 0 0 26px;
      }

      .page-intro {
        max-width: 720px;
        font-size: 19px;
        color: var(--muted);
        line-height: 1.8;
        margin-bottom: 90px;
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <HeaderKo />

    <main class="page">
      <p class="page-label">PEOPLE</p>

      <h1>구성원</h1>

      <p class="page-intro">
        부유체 동역학 연구실은 해양 부유체 시스템,
        해양 유체동역학, 부유체–계류 연성 동역학,
        그리고 지능형 해양 시스템 제어 기술을 연구합니다.
      </p>

      <ProfessorProfile />
      <StudentsSection />
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>